# Run It Again / One Branch Forks. Image 2: a low view from a Queensland veranda.
# GumView(blueTip twigDepth). Use blueTip=1 for the drawn fork; 0 grows a leafed fork.
# TwigDepth 0, 1 or 2 controls successive fork generations on every foliage spray.
# Main boughs keep their traced silhouettes. The editor seed varies leaves and spray angles.
# Approximate metres, Y up. Reproduce the preview from (0, 0.92, 4.4), facing -Z
# with 12 degrees of upward pitch, 54.2 degrees horizontal field of view, 16:9.
# Heights, hidden surfaces and out-of-frame limbs are inferred from a single view.
